ss_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"MIKYzWkBnbo3YUhqZUWlEw","review_id":"KaIwsx5l54EArfXacAVdXw","date":"2016-10-06T18:50:26","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9549532532691956,"text_excerpt":"There is a lot of by the slice places on Bourbon street, often designed just to get your sober enough to order more drinks, but this place is dedicated to the pizza. I went in the middle of the afternoon, around 330-4pm so it was super quiet. I tried a chicken bacon crunch pizza (or something like that) which was quite delicious and unique. Sure it's thin and greasy, but that's what most by the slice pizza is. I'll also echo what Jasmine T. said... it was just the right temperature... not too hot that the toppings all slid off or that you would burn yourself, but warmer than room temperature... just right to enjoy. Unlike others though this has great flavor and interesting toppings. At $5..."},{"business_id":"MIKYzWkBnbo3YUhqZUWlEw","review_id":"Qe0beqe0z7yMiIQwQ3GEgw","date":"2019-05-19T22:47:13","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9451397657394409,"text_excerpt":"this was great pizza after a night of too much alcohol! we came here twice on our visit to new orleans, because it was so quick and easy. there are many spots on bourbon street to grab a quick slice, but this place was the best from what i'd seen. it's brightly lit unlike the other joints, and very clean in the inside. i tried both the pepperoni and cheese slices, both were really good. they were greasy but this is to be expected from pizza. a lot of people say you will only need one piece since the slices are big, but if you've been drinking and haven't eaten all day you might be able to finish two. i was able to eat one and a half slices after not eating since breakfast. the slices are ..."},{"business_id":"MIKYzWkBnbo3YUhqZUWlEw","review_id":"n-ub9GW7Mpi7GvtJI3YzVQ","date":"2017-02-17T16:11:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9431405663490295,"text_excerpt":"Pizza, pizza, pizza!! Pizza by the slice was exactly what I needed after a night of leisurely drinking. Oh cheeeeeesy heavenly goodness. I got the cheeseburger pizza, which tasted very much like a cheeseburger. It was topped with burger patty chunks, pickles and lotsa cheese! Funny how myself and my group ended up there twice in one night. Yes, their pizza is that good. Like Kimberly H. said in her review \"bomb ass pizza\". It certainly was! You walk in, order your slice that is already prepared and properly labeled, then you pay. If you want a whole pie, just order in advance! It was delicious and I can't wait to be back. If you are on Bourbon Street, definitely check out this pizza place..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"MIKYzWkBnbo3YUhqZUWlEw","photo_id":"Ddvf55kiOwKZyoySjMRVow","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/Ddvf55kiOwKZyoySjMRVow.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8594731092453003},{"business_id":"MIKYzWkBnbo3YUhqZUWlEw","photo_id":"gXIfSrfT2bo6sHS2RIOSwA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/gXIfSrfT2bo6sHS2RIOSwA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8567341566085815},{"business_id":"MIKYzWkBnbo3YUhqZUWlEw","photo_id":"k7y52tPQAAEUo8a9-abJfQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/k7y52tPQAAEUo8a9-abJfQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.830090343952179},{"business_id":"MIKYzWkBnbo3YUhqZUWlEw","photo_id":"3M1jEc